  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Transitional Justice Initiatives to Advance Accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective: Transitional justice processes in Colombia are implemented in a way that advances accountability of all actors to the internal armed conflict and the fulfillment of victims&#x2019; rights. ICTJ will work closely with a range of state actors and civil society in accordance with ICTJ&#x2019;s annual stakeholder analysis. These will include the SJP, TC and Search Unit, judicial operators, LGBTI, women&#x2019;s and victims&#x2019; organizations, former combatants, and corporate and alternative media.</narrative>
  </description>
